ow, namespace names up to 63 characters are supported.    \nAction: Required\nLifecycle: Deleted\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-08-19\nValid as Of: 2025-09-01\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 173 ---\nComponent: Cloud Integration\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: BigCommerce Receiver Adapter Available\nDescription: BigCommerce receiver adapter is available now. It facilitates connectivity with BigCommerce GraphQL and REST Admin APIs.  See:   BigCommerce Receiver Adapter    BigCommerce Receiver GraphQL Adapter    BigCommerce Receiver Rest Adapter    \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-09-01\nValid as Of: 2025-09-01\nVersion: 2507\n\n--- Record 174 ---\nComponent: SAP AI Core\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Generative AI hub\nDescription: SAP Document Management is supported as a repository type for the orchestration grounding module.For more information, see Grounding Generic Secrets for SAP Document Management Service. \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-09-01\nValid as Of: 2025-09-01\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 175 ---\nComponent: SAP AI Core\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Generative AI hub\nDescription: Orchestration model configurations have timeout and max tries parameters. For more information, see Templating. \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-09-01\nValid as Of: 2025-09-01\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 176 ---\nComponent: SAP AI Launchpad\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Generative AI hub\nDescription: SAP Build WorkZone is supported as a repository type for the orchestration grounding module.  For more information, see Create a Generic Secret for AI Data Management.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Busine